cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the version and Git commit used for your measurements."
title: "Beam Lab: local beam profiler"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Warring
    given-names: Ulrich
    affiliation: University of Freiburg
version: 0.3.2
date-released: 2026-09-24
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/uwarring82/beam-profiler"
url: "https://github.com/uwarring82/beam-profiler"
abstract: "Local laser beam profiler with a browser UI and Python acquisition from GenICam cameras via Aravis. Computes intensity-weighted centroids, D4σ diameters and principal axes on native pixels, with a rolling single-frame repeatability estimate and an explicit partial uncertainty budget. Exports raw TIFF, profiles and full measurement metadata."
keywords:
  - beam profiling
  - laser optics
  - D4sigma
  - measurement uncertainty
  - GenICam
  - scientific imaging
